ity from 0 to 1 over half a second (or specified frames)."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.fadeOut", "description": "Fades out the chart by decreasing the CSS opacity from 1 to 0 over specified frames."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.fadeSlideIn", "description": "Fades in the chart with a sliding motion starting from outside the canvas."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.fadeSlideOut", "description": "Fades out the chart with a sliding motion towards outside."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.fadeCircularInOutwards", "description": "Applies a radial gradient covering the canvas from transparent to opaque, creating a circular fade-in effect."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.fadeCircularOutOutwards", "description": "Applies a radial gradient to cover the canvas from opaque to transparent, creating a circular fade-out effect."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.fadeCircularInInwards", "description": "Radially reveals the canvas from the center outwards with an inward fade."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.fadeCircularOutInwards", "description": "Covers the canvas with a radial gradient from center outwards, creating an inward fade conceal."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.expand", "description": "Expands the chart from the center outward with optional bouncing animation."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.contract", "description": "Contracts the chart from full size to the center, with optional bounce."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.reveal", "description": "Reveals the chart by shrinking four divs from edges inward to the center."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.revealCircular", "description": "Reveals the chart with a circular mask expanding from the center."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.conceal", "description": "Conceals the chart by expanding divs from the center outward."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.hBlindsOpen", "description": "Animates horizontal blind opening effect across the chart."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.hBlindsClose", "description": "Animates horizontal blind closing effect."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.vBlindsOpen", "description": "Animates vertical blind opening."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.vBlindsClose", "description": "Animates vertical blind closing."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.slideIn", "description": "Slides the chart into view from a specified direction (left, top, bottom, right)."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.slideOut", "description": "Slides the chart out of view to a specified direction."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.hscissorsopen", "description": "Animates horizontal scissors opening effect."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.hscissorsclose", "description": "Animates horizontal scissors closing."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.vscissorsopen", "description": "Animates vertical scissors opening."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.vscissorsclose", "description": "Animates vertical scissors closing."}, {"name": "RGBA.effects.animate", "description": "Performs a generic property animation on the chart object similar to jQuery's animate."}, {"name": "AnonymousFunctione858f52f0100()", "scope": "RG.Effects.Common.fadeIn", "scopeKind": "function", "description": "unavailable"}, {"name": "AnonymousFunctione858f52f0200()", "scope": "RG.Effects.Common.fadeIn", "scopeKind": "function", "description": "unavailable"}, {"name": "AnonymousFunctione858f52f0300()", "scope": "RG.Effects.Common.fadeOut", "scopeKind": "function", "description": "unavailable"}, {"name": "AnonymousFunctione858f52f0400()", "scope": "RG.Effects.Common.fadeOut", "scopeKind": "function", "description": "unavailable"}, {"name": "AnonymousFunctione858f52f0500()", "scope": "", "scopeKind": "", "description": "unavailable"}, {"name": "AnonymousFunctione858f52f0600()", "scope": "", "scopeKind": "", "description": "unavailable"}, {"name": "AnonymousFunctione858f52f0700()", "scope": "", "scopeKind": "", "description": "unavailable"}, {"name": "AnonymousFunctione858f52f0800()", "scope": "", "scopeKind": "", "description": "unavailable"}, {"name": "AnonymousFunctione858f52f0900()", "scope": "", "scopeKind": "", "description": "unavailable"}, {"name": "AnonymousFunctione858f52f0a00()"